    "format": 1,
    "content": "<div class=\"df-rules-journal\"><header class=\"df-rules-page-header\"><h1>Armor and Shields</h1></header>\n<h2>Armor and Shields</h2>\n<p>Armor reduces incoming damage.</p>\n<p>Your total Armor is:</p>\n<p><code>Armor Value + Shield Value + Mastery Rank + other Armor bonuses</code></p>\n<p>Subtract total Armor from incoming damage.</p>\n<p>Armor applies to attacks and damage instances unless a rule says the damage ignores Armor.</p>\n<p>Ongoing Special damage usually ignores Armor.</p>\n<hr>\n<h3>Armor Types</h3>\n<table class=\"df-rules-table\">\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th align=\"left\"><strong>Armor Type</strong></th>\n<th align=\"center\"><strong>Armor Value</strong></th>\n<th align=\"center\"><strong>Evade</strong></th>\n<th align=\"center\"><strong>Initiative</strong></th>\n<th align=\"left\"><strong>Skill Penalty</strong></th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td align=\"left\"><strong>Light</strong></td>\n<td align=\"center\">+4</td>\n<td align=\"center\">+0</td>\n<td align=\"center\">—</td>\n<td align=\"left\">—</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"left\"><strong>Medium</strong></td>\n<td align=\"center\">+8</td>\n<td align=\"center\">−2</td>\n<td align=\"center\">−4</td>\n<td align=\"left\">−1d8 to Physical Skill checks</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"left\"><strong>Heavy</strong></td>\n<td align=\"center\">+12</td>\n<td align=\"center\">−4</td>\n<td align=\"center\">−8</td>\n<td align=\"left\">−2d8 to Physical Skill checks</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h3>Shield Types</h3>\n<table class=\"df-rules-table\">\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th align=\"left\"><strong>Shield Type</strong></th>\n<th align=\"center\"><strong>Armor Value</strong></th>\n<th align=\"center\"><strong>Evade</strong></th>\n<th align=\"center\"><strong>Initiative</strong></th>\n<th align=\"left\"><strong>Skill Penalty</strong></th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td align=\"left\"><strong>Parry Shield</strong></td>\n<td align=\"center\">+1</td>\n<td align=\"center\">+4</td>\n<td align=\"center\">—</td>\n<td align=\"left\">−1d8 to Physical Skill checks</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"left\"><strong>Medium Shield</strong></td>\n<td align=\"center\">+4</td>\n<td align=\"center\">+0</td>\n<td align=\"center\">—</td>\n<td align=\"left\">−2d8 to Physical Skill checks</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"left\"><strong>Tower Shield</strong></td>\n<td align=\"center\">+8</td>\n<td align=\"center\">−4</td>\n<td align=\"center\">−4</td>\n<td align=\"left\">−2d8 to Physical Skill checks</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n</div>"
